#EXTINF:695 group-title="James Frazer",The Golden Bough Part 3 The Dying God — James Frazer · I. THE MORTALITY OF THE GODS. Mortality of Savage Gods- Mortality of Greek Gods- Mortatlity of Egyptian Gods- Death of the Great Pan- Deaths of the King of the Jinn and of the Grape Cluster - Read by Leon Harvey - Duration 00:11:35
